[463.319, "o", "\r\n\u001b[97m⏺ The pointer trail shows a glowing, colour-shifting wake that fades from gold to pink. The rings near the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  pointer ring at the right bulge toward it. I'm snapshotting this step now.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
